{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Élisabeth Jérémine (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a ridge on the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kerguelen_Islands\" title=\"Kerguelen Islands\">Kerguelen Islands</a> is named after <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Élisabeth_Jérémine\" title=\"Élisabeth Jérémine\">Élisabeth Jérémine</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i>, a Russian-French geologist who analysed rocks from the islands?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89lisabeth_J%C3%A9r%C3%A9mine","retrieved":1788293086792},{"title":"maps (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that some <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Map\" title=\"Map\">maps</a></b> contain  non-existent places inserted by the cartographers to detect copyright infringement?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Map","retrieved":1788293086793},{"title":"the incumbent prime minister of Serbia (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Đuro_Macut\" title=\"Đuro Macut\">the incumbent prime minister of Serbia</a></b> is not a member of any political party?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C4%90uro_Macut","retrieved":1788293086795},{"title":"Palatine colossi (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatine_colossi\" title=\"Palatine colossi\">Palatine colossi</a></b> were buried beneath the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palazzo_della_Pilotta\" title=\"Palazzo della Pilotta\">Palazzo della Pilotta</a> during the Second World War?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatine_colossi","retrieved":1788293086796},{"title":"Barry Pryor (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barry_Pryor\" title=\"Barry Pryor\">Barry Pryor</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> plays in a 1969 American football game were credited to <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gary_Tucker\" title=\"Gary Tucker\">Gary Tucker</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barry_Pryor","retrieved":1788293086798},{"title":"a tavern brawl (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a future U.S. president and a future U.S. senator tried to kill and injure each other in <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson–Benton_brawl_of_1813\" title=\"Jackson–Benton brawl of 1813\">a tavern brawl</a></b> that involved guns, knives, and a horsewhip?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson%E2%80%93Benton_brawl_of_1813","retrieved":1788293086799},{"title":"Elaine Larsen (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elaine_Larsen\" title=\"Elaine Larsen\">Elaine Larsen</a></b>, a champion drag racer, was raised in a Mennonite family that strongly limited the use of technology?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elaine_Larsen","retrieved":1788293086801},{"title":"Tennessee's official bicentennial rap (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennessee_Bicentennial_Rap\" title=\"Tennessee Bicentennial Rap\">Tennessee's official bicentennial rap</a></b> was described as \"an unlistenable novelty song\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennessee_Bicentennial_Rap","retrieved":1788293086802},{"title":"Lillian Droniak (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that 96-year-old social-media influencer <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lillian_Droniak\" title=\"Lillian Droniak\">Lillian Droniak</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> proposed rules for her funeral include a requirement to get drunk?","link"